sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Checkout
    actor C as Customer
    box Backend services
      participant API as Order API
      participant PAY as Payments
    end
    participant Q as Event bus
    C->>+API: POST /orders
    API->>PAY: charge
    PAY-xAPI: declined
    API->>PAY: charge (retry)
    PAY-->>API: ok
    Note over API,PAY: payment settled
    par notify
      API-)Q: OrderPlaced
    and respond
      API-->>-C: 201 Created
    end
    loop every 5s
      C->>API: GET /orders/1
    end
